# Bill of Materials (BOM)

## 3D Printing
* [1–2 kg PLA Filament](https://www.amazon.com/s?k=PLA+filament+1kg)

## Motors & Servos
* [20kg DS Servos (Standard Size)](https://www.amazon.com/s?k=20kg+digital+servo) (2x)
* [MG90S Micro Servo](https://www.amazon.com/s?k=MG90S+micro+servo) (1x)
* [TT Motors with Wheels Set](https://www.amazon.com/s?k=TT+motor+with+wheels) (4x motors & wheels)
* Stock Servo Horns & Hardware (Included with servos)
* [REV Servo Horn](https://www.revrobotics.com/) (1x - REV Robotics)

## Electronics & Controllers
* [Raspberry Pi Pico W](https://www.amazon.com/s?k=Raspberry+Pi+Pico+W) (1x)
* [PCA9685 16-Channel Servo Driver](https://www.amazon.com/s?k=PCA9685+servo+driver) (1x)
* [L298N Dual H-Bridge Motor Drivers](https://www.amazon.com/s?k=L298N+motor+driver) (2x)
* [Breadboard Variety Pack (Half & Mini)](https://www.amazon.com/s?k=half+breadboard+mini+breadboard) (1x Half, 1x Mini)

## Hardware & Power
* [M3 and M4 Metric Screw Assortment Kit](https://www.amazon.com/s?k=M3+M4+screw+assortment+kit)
* [9V Rechargeable Batteries & Battery Harnesses](https://www.amazon.com/s?k=9V+rechargeable+batteries+with+clip) (2x)
* [5V Mini Portable Power Bank for Pico](https://www.amazon.com/s?k=mini+5v+power+bank) (1x)
